WEBVTT

00:09.060 --> 00:13.727
- Maybe I'll do
a cute little button.
- 也许我会做
一个可爱的小按钮。

00:13.727 --> 00:16.993
Or something a bit more manly
perhaps.
或者更有男子气概的东西
也许。

00:16.993 --> 00:20.593
[grunts]
[咕哝]

00:20.593 --> 00:23.727
Upturned might be good, too.
朝上也许也不错。

00:26.293 --> 00:29.360
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

00:29.360 --> 00:31.760
- Hi, Squidward.
- 嗨，章鱼哥。

00:31.760 --> 00:34.727
- Great.
The idiot found me.
- 伟大的。
那个白痴发现了我。

00:34.727 --> 00:37.593
- Whatcha doing?
- I'm picking a nose.
- 在做什么？
- 我在抠鼻子。

00:37.593 --> 00:39.927
- Ooh!
I used to pick my nose too,
- 哦！
我也经常挖鼻孔

00:39.927 --> 00:43.060
until I finally
cleared it out.
直到我终于
把它清除了。

00:46.060 --> 00:49.093
- I'm not picking my nose,
SpongeBob.
- 我没有挖鼻孔
海绵宝宝。

00:49.093 --> 00:52.993
I'm on the way to the hospital
for a nose job.
我正在去医院的路上
鼻子整形手术。

00:52.993 --> 00:54.727
Plastic surgery.
整形外科。

00:54.727 --> 00:56.627
I'm finally gonna get
the nose
我终于要得到
鼻子

00:56.627 --> 00:58.560
I should have been born with.
我应该是天生的。

00:58.560 --> 01:02.393
- [gasps] But, Squidward,
you're a beautiful flower.
- [喘气]但是，章鱼哥，
你是一朵美丽的花。

01:02.393 --> 01:08.327
You don't need to change
a--ay--yay--yay--ay--
你不需要改变
啊--哎--耶--耶--哎--

01:08.327 --> 01:10.027
Well, maybe a little work
wouldn't hurt.
好吧，也许需要一点工作
不会受伤。

01:10.027 --> 01:12.960
Hey, you want a ride?
- With you? Absolutely not.
嘿，你想搭车吗？
- 与你？绝对不是。

01:12.960 --> 01:16.527
- Aww, come on, Squidward.
- 哇哦，来吧，章鱼哥。

01:16.527 --> 01:20.293
I can get you there
lickity-split.
我可以带你去那里
舔度分裂。

01:20.293 --> 01:23.993
[siren blaring]
[警笛鸣响]

01:23.993 --> 01:25.193
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

01:25.193 --> 01:27.260
- You can't dump
your garbage here, sir.
- 你不能倾倒
你的垃圾在这里，先生。

01:27.260 --> 01:29.893
- Oh, that's not garbage.
That's my friend, Squidward.
- 哦，那不是垃圾。
那是我的朋友，章鱼哥。

01:29.893 --> 01:34.493
We're here to check in.
我们是来办理登机手续的。

01:34.493 --> 01:38.427
- Holy nostroly! You must be
here for the nose job.
- 神圣的诺斯特罗利！你一定是
在这里进行鼻子整形手术。

01:38.427 --> 01:42.793
Let's, uh, get your paperwork
filled out.
让我们，呃，拿到你的文件
填写。

01:42.793 --> 01:44.127
- You just relax, sir.
- 你放松点，先生。

01:44.127 --> 01:46.727
The doctor will be ready
for you soon.
医生会准备好
很快就给你了。

01:46.727 --> 01:49.860
- [inhales deeply]
Ah. This is nice.
- [深吸一口气]
啊。这很好。

01:49.860 --> 01:51.493
- Never fear, Squidward.
- 别害怕，章鱼哥。

01:51.493 --> 01:54.360
Soon this dreary old room
will be so full of well-wishing
很快这个沉闷的旧房间
都会充满美好的祝愿

01:54.360 --> 01:55.727
you'll never want to go home.
你永远不想回家。

01:55.727 --> 01:57.427
- Five minutes later.
- 五分钟后。

01:57.427 --> 02:01.593
- [grunting] SpongeBob,
get this garbage out of here.
- [咕哝]海绵宝宝，
把这些垃圾赶出这里。

02:01.593 --> 02:02.960
I can hardly move.
我几乎无法动弹。

02:02.960 --> 02:06.293
- Oh, are you uncomfortable?
Here, let me help.
-哦，你不舒服吗？
在这里，让我帮忙。

02:06.293 --> 02:09.593
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

02:09.593 --> 02:13.193
- I love you.
- The bed is fine!
- 我爱你。
- 床很好！

02:13.193 --> 02:15.160
- Fluff your pillow?
- No.
- 弄松你的枕头？
- 不。

02:15.160 --> 02:18.727
- Fluff your IV bag?
- [grunting]
- 弄乱你的静脉输液袋？
- [咕哝]

02:18.727 --> 02:21.027
Enough, you buffoon!
够了，你这个小丑！

02:21.027 --> 02:23.993
- Well, gee, Squidward,
I was just trying to be helpful.
- 嗯，哎呀，章鱼哥，
我只是想帮忙。

02:23.993 --> 02:26.393
- If you want
to help so badly,
- 如果你愿意的话
提供如此严重的帮助，

02:26.393 --> 02:31.093
why don't you just go volunteer
to be a candy striper?
你为什么不去当志愿者呢
成为一名糖果脱衣舞者？

02:31.093 --> 02:32.293
There's plenty of other people
in the hospital
还有很多其他人
在医院

02:32.293 --> 02:33.527
you could torture.
你可以折磨。

02:33.527 --> 02:36.327
- Squidward,
that's a great idea.
- 章鱼哥，
这是个好主意。

02:36.327 --> 02:38.260
I was born to serve.
我生来就是为了服务。

02:42.560 --> 02:44.927
Hello, lady, can I be
a candy striper here at the--
你好，女士，我可以吗
这里有一个糖果条纹工——

02:44.927 --> 02:47.027
- Grab a uniform
out of the closet.
- 穿上制服
从壁橱里出来。

02:47.027 --> 02:51.460
- Ooh, thank you!
Thank you! Whoo!
- 哦，谢谢你！
谢谢你！呼！

02:51.460 --> 02:55.527
Ooh! Candy stripes.
哦！糖果条纹。

02:55.527 --> 02:58.093
[gulps]
Strawberry.
[吞咽]
草莓。

02:58.093 --> 03:00.960
- Ah, Doctor,
Thank goodness you're here.
- 啊，医生，
谢天谢地你还在这里。

03:00.960 --> 03:03.060
- We were just looking
for another physician
- 我们只是在寻找
为另一位医生

03:03.060 --> 03:05.960
to join us on our rounds.
加入我们的巡演。

03:05.960 --> 03:08.160
And what seems to be
the problem today?
以及似乎是什么
今天的问题是什么？

03:08.160 --> 03:11.327
- [coughing]
My throat hurts.
- [咳嗽]
我的喉咙很痛。

03:11.327 --> 03:13.793
- Prescribe him
a numbing throat spray.
- 给他开药
使喉咙麻木的喷雾剂

03:13.793 --> 03:15.893
Let's move on, shall we?
- Wait a second.
我们继续吧，好吗？
- 等一下。

03:15.893 --> 03:20.727
I think
I've seen this before.
我认为
我以前见过这个。

03:20.727 --> 03:24.727
Mm, yeah.
嗯，是的。

03:24.727 --> 03:27.027
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

03:27.027 --> 03:30.160
I'll need one medical
sea-chicken.
我需要一名医疗人员
海鸡。

03:33.493 --> 03:35.427
- [squawks]
- [嘎嘎声]

03:37.827 --> 03:40.860
- [giggling, laughing]
- [咯咯笑，大笑]

03:40.860 --> 03:43.960
[coughing]
[咳嗽]

03:43.960 --> 03:47.960
Hey, my keys.
And my throat feels better.
嘿，我的钥匙。
我的喉咙感觉好多了。

03:47.960 --> 03:50.827
- You see, doctors,
catfish are bottom feeders.
- 你看，医生们，
鲶鱼是底层饲养者。

03:50.827 --> 03:52.493
The dirt on his face
led me to believe
他脸上的污垢
让我相信

03:52.493 --> 03:55.193
he had recently eaten something
that irritated his throat.
他最近吃了一些东西
这刺激了他的喉咙。

03:55.193 --> 03:57.293
Happens to my friend Patrick
all the time.
发生在我朋友帕特里克身上
一直。

03:57.293 --> 04:01.727
[grunts]
Mm-hmm.
[咕哝]
嗯嗯。

04:01.727 --> 04:03.327
Try a krabby patty
next time, sir.
尝试蟹肉饼
下次，先生。

04:03.327 --> 04:06.493
They go down smooth, and they
taste better than car keys.
他们进展顺利，而且他们
味道比车钥匙还好。

04:06.493 --> 04:09.093
- Thanks doc.
- No need to thank me, sir.
- 谢谢医生。
- 不用谢我，先生。

04:09.093 --> 04:12.993
I'm here to help.
我是来帮忙的。

04:12.993 --> 04:14.727
- What treatment
might you prescribe
- 什么治疗
你可以开处方吗

04:14.727 --> 04:16.760
for this next patient,
Doctor?
对于下一个病人，
医生？

04:16.760 --> 04:17.760
- So what do you think?
- 那你觉得怎么样？

04:17.760 --> 04:19.093
Will I be able to run
我能跑吗

04:19.093 --> 04:21.827
in the Bikini Bottom marathon
next week?
在比基尼泳裤马拉松中
下周？

04:21.827 --> 04:24.493
- Oh, my, no.
I'm afraid you're--
- 哦，天哪，不。
我担心你是——

04:24.493 --> 04:27.893
- Of course. Friends don't let
friends miss marathons.
- 当然。朋友不让
朋友们怀念马拉松。

04:27.893 --> 04:30.460
We'll have you up
in no time.
我们会扶你起床
很快。

04:30.460 --> 04:32.960
Ah!
啊!

04:32.960 --> 04:37.093
- What are you--
[both grunting]
- 你是什么--
[两人都咕哝着]

04:38.960 --> 04:41.727
- Most unorthodox.
- 最不正统的。

04:41.727 --> 04:44.893
- He's a genius.
- 他是个天才。

04:44.893 --> 04:47.727
- Thanks, doc.
- Ready, set.
- 谢谢，博士。
- 准备好，开始。

04:47.727 --> 04:51.527
[horn blaring]
[喇叭声]

04:51.527 --> 04:54.593
- And what seems to be
your problem today, ma'am?
- 看起来是什么
女士，您今天有什么问题吗？

04:54.593 --> 04:57.193
- Sometimes
I Just don't have it in me
- 有时
我只是没有它在我身上

04:57.193 --> 05:00.993
to puff up
under my own power.
膨胀
在我自己的力量之下。

05:00.993 --> 05:04.193
- Hi, Mrs. Puff.
- No! Not you!
- 嗨，普芙女士。
- 不！不是你！

05:04.193 --> 05:07.527
[whimpering]
What are you doing here?
[呜咽]
你在这里做什么？

05:07.527 --> 05:11.727
- Don't worry, Mrs. Puff.
I'm a doctor...today.
- 别担心，帕芙女士。
我是一名医生……今天。

05:11.727 --> 05:13.527
What is this crazy thing?
这是什么疯狂的事情？

05:13.527 --> 05:16.060
Looks like some sort
of weird submarine.
看起来像是某种
奇怪的潜艇。

05:16.060 --> 05:17.760
- You're kidding,
of course.
- 你在开玩笑吧
当然。

05:17.760 --> 05:21.160
We've placed her in an iron lung
to help puff her back up.
我们把她放进铁肺里
帮助她振作起来。

05:21.160 --> 05:24.527
- Ha-ha! Dive! Dive!
Up periscope!
- 哈哈！潜水！潜水！
潜望镜上来！

05:24.527 --> 05:30.293
Load the torpedoes.
[imitates farting]
装载鱼雷。
[模仿放屁]

05:30.293 --> 05:32.227
[laughing]
[笑]

05:35.093 --> 05:39.127
- Help me.
[screaming]
- 帮我。
[尖叫]

05:39.127 --> 05:42.260
- Hey!
[all screaming]
- 嘿！
[所有人尖叫]

05:55.560 --> 05:57.527
- My legs!
- 我的腿！

05:57.527 --> 05:58.927
- Never fear, Mrs. Puff.
- 别害怕，普夫夫人。

05:58.927 --> 06:02.027
I haven't lost a patient
all day.
我没有失去一个病人
一整天。

06:02.027 --> 06:05.493
Let's get medical.
我们去就医吧

06:05.493 --> 06:07.893
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

06:07.893 --> 06:10.460
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

06:10.460 --> 06:11.927
- Oh, no.
- 哦，不。

06:11.927 --> 06:14.027
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

06:14.027 --> 06:18.460
Oh. Actually, I feel like
my old self again.
哦。其实我觉得
又是我的旧我。

06:18.460 --> 06:22.727
But you still don't get
a driver's license.
但你还是不明白
驾驶执照。

06:22.727 --> 06:24.360
Oh!
哦！

06:24.360 --> 06:28.393
- Wow. I've never seen anyone
work an iron lung like that.
- 哇。我从未见过任何人
像这样工作铁肺。

06:28.393 --> 06:30.127
- So awesome.
- 太棒了。

06:30.127 --> 06:32.493
- We were on our way
to perform a surgery...
- 我们正在路上
进行手术...

06:32.493 --> 06:35.960
- But we would be honored
to watch you perform it.
- 但我们会很荣幸
观看你执行它。

06:35.960 --> 06:39.093
- Me?
Perform a surgery?
- 我？
进行手术吗？

06:42.493 --> 06:45.360
- Oh, yeah,
this is the life.
- 哦，是的，
这就是生活。

06:45.360 --> 06:50.493
And best of all, there's no
SpongeBob here to ruin it.
最重要的是，没有
海绵宝宝来毁掉它。

06:50.493 --> 06:54.427
- Oh, boy, surgery.
And on my first day too.
- 哦，孩子，手术。
我的第一天也是如此。

06:54.427 --> 06:57.827
- SpongeBob? No!
What are you doing here?
- 海绵宝宝？不！
你在这里做什么？

06:57.827 --> 07:00.793
- Nighty night,
Mr. Tentacles.
- 晚安的夜晚，
触手先生。

07:00.793 --> 07:02.593
- Wait, wait, no, no, no, no!
- 等等，等等，不，不，不，不！

07:02.593 --> 07:05.593
[snoring]
[打鼾]

07:07.727 --> 07:11.060
- Oh, hi, everybody.
all: Hi, SpongeBob.
- 噢，大家好。
全体：嗨，海绵宝宝。

07:11.060 --> 07:13.327
- Doctor,
the patient's over here,
- 医生，
病人在这里

07:13.327 --> 07:15.227
and he's ready for you
to begin.
他已经为你准备好了
开始。

07:15.227 --> 07:19.960
- Oh, we're most eager to see
which tool you select first.
- 哦，我们最渴望看到
您首先选择哪个工具。

07:19.960 --> 07:23.927
- Hmm, mm--mm-mm--mm.
Let me see.
- 嗯，毫米--毫米-毫米--毫米。
让我看看。

07:23.927 --> 07:27.827
Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Phew.
哇哇哇！
唷。

07:27.827 --> 07:29.160
Here we go.
开始了。

07:29.160 --> 07:31.727
[triumphant music]
[胜利的音乐]

07:31.727 --> 07:34.493
[yawning]
[打哈欠]

07:34.493 --> 07:36.027
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

07:36.027 --> 07:40.727
all: Ooh!
Ah!
全体：噢！
啊!

07:40.727 --> 07:43.393
- Okay, SpongeBob,
this can't be too hard.
- 好吧，海绵宝宝，
这不会太难。

07:43.393 --> 07:46.327
Just make an incision here,
and--no!
在这里切个切口就可以了
还有——不！

07:46.327 --> 07:48.627
Shoot!
Son of a gun!
射击！
枪之子！

07:48.627 --> 07:50.760
Ah, my bad.
啊，我的错。

07:50.760 --> 07:53.093
- I'll take that.
- 我会接受的。

07:53.093 --> 07:56.227
- Ah-ha! Mmm, sushi.
- 啊哈！嗯，寿司。

07:58.527 --> 08:02.860
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:02.860 --> 08:05.860
Eeh.
呃。

08:05.860 --> 08:09.660
He's uh, really going to pieces
over this nose job.
他呃，真的要崩溃了
关于这个鼻子整形手术。

08:09.660 --> 08:11.327
[laughter]
[笑声]

08:11.327 --> 08:14.227
Oh. [chuckles]
Thank you.
哦。 [笑声]
谢谢你。

08:14.227 --> 08:17.027
Let's try again, shall we?
我们再试一次，好吗？

08:17.027 --> 08:19.160
[whistling]
[吹口哨]

08:21.893 --> 08:23.827
Order up!
赶快下单吧！

08:23.827 --> 08:26.960
[laughter and applause]
[笑声和掌声]

08:30.427 --> 08:33.627
Yow!
That shouldn't be in there.
哟！
那不应该在那里。

08:33.627 --> 08:37.427
Ooh!
哦！

08:37.427 --> 08:39.793
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:39.793 --> 08:42.293
What?
什么？

08:42.293 --> 08:43.427
Oh.
哦。

08:43.427 --> 08:44.993
- Ta-da!
- 哒哒！

08:44.993 --> 08:47.527
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

08:47.527 --> 08:50.427
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

08:50.427 --> 08:52.360
Nurse, sponge.
护士，海绵。

08:55.860 --> 08:58.193
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

08:58.193 --> 08:59.427
- Thank you, nurse.
- 谢谢你，护士。

08:59.427 --> 09:01.727
- I can't see!
I can't see!
- 我看不到！
我看不见！

09:01.727 --> 09:04.727
I want to see!
[grunting]
我想看看！
[咕噜声]

09:08.293 --> 09:12.060
I still can't see.
我还是看不清。

09:12.060 --> 09:15.193
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

09:18.827 --> 09:21.327
[organ music]
[管风琴音乐]

09:21.327 --> 09:22.627
- Ta da!
- 哒哒！

09:22.627 --> 09:26.793
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

09:26.793 --> 09:28.927
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

09:28.927 --> 09:30.060
There we go.
我们开始吧。

09:30.060 --> 09:31.360
You can wake him up now,
nurse.
你现在可以叫醒他了
护士。

09:31.360 --> 09:34.727
- [groaning]
What--what happened?
- [呻吟]
发生了什么事？

09:34.727 --> 09:37.460
- I finished your nose job,
you silly goose.
- 我完成了你的鼻子整形手术
你这个傻鹅。

09:37.460 --> 09:38.727
Take a look.
看看吧。

09:38.727 --> 09:40.627
- SpongeBob, you idiot.
- 海绵宝宝，你这个白痴。

09:40.627 --> 09:43.093
This isn't even close
to what I wanted.
这还差得很远
到我想要的。

09:43.093 --> 09:45.760
- Well, why didn't you say so?
Oh, nurse!
- 那么，你为什么不这么说呢？
哦，护士！

09:45.760 --> 09:49.093
- Wait, no, no, no!
I want a different doctor. I--
- 等等，不，不，不！
我想要一个不同的医生。我 -

09:52.760 --> 09:55.093
No.
不。

09:55.093 --> 09:57.127
No.
No.
不。
不。

09:57.127 --> 09:59.527
No.
No.
不。
不。

09:59.527 --> 10:01.860
No.
No.
不。
不。

10:01.860 --> 10:04.727
No!
No.
不！
不。

10:04.727 --> 10:07.727
No.
No--o--o--o--o!
不。
不——哦——哦——哦——哦！

10:13.727 --> 10:17.760
Stop! I don't want to change
my nose anymore.
停止！我不想改变
我的鼻子了。

10:17.760 --> 10:20.727
SpongeBob, I'll do anything.
Anything at--
海绵宝宝，我愿意做任何事。
任何事情都在——

10:20.727 --> 10:24.060
- How's about
the Squidward Classic?
- 怎么样
章鱼哥经典？

10:24.060 --> 10:26.293
- Hey, not bad.
- 嘿，还不错。

10:26.293 --> 10:28.893
This looks even better
than my old nose.
这看起来更好
比我的老鼻子

10:28.893 --> 10:31.860
- Well, I did have to use
a few of your other body parts
- 好吧，我确实必须使用
你身体的一些其他部位

10:31.860 --> 10:34.993
to re-sculpt it.
重新雕刻它。

10:34.993 --> 10:37.860
D'oh! Look at the time.
I have to go to work.
噢！看看时间。
我得去上班了。

10:37.860 --> 10:40.193
- But you're a doctor.
You're at work.
- 但你是一名医生。
你正在工作。

10:40.193 --> 10:42.160
- No, I'm just a fry cook.
- 不，我只是个炒菜的厨师。

10:42.160 --> 10:44.760
But it was fun
playing with you guys. Bye!
但这很有趣
和你们一起玩。再见！

10:44.760 --> 10:48.893
- Fry cook?
Ooh.
- 炒菜做饭？
哦。

10:48.893 --> 10:50.627
- Don't be afraid, ladies.
- 别害怕，女士们。

10:50.627 --> 10:53.727
This sinus Adonis
is on the market.
这窦阿多尼斯
已上市。

10:53.727 --> 10:54.627
[both gasping]
[两人都喘气]

[两人都喘气]